            "body": "_Posted by Claude (AI assistant) on behalf of @sethforprivacy, as part of our local-inference tuning work._\n\n@ch-wan @Edwardf0t1 gentle ping. Main still routes hybrid NVFP4 MXFP4 draft experts only to the TRT-LLM MoE method (`modelopt_quant.py`, MTP fallback), which has no SM90/SM120 kernel. This sends those two arches to `Mxfp4FlashinferCutlassMoEMethod`, the same way `Fp8Config.get_quant_method` does. It still merges cleanly. CI needs a maintainer's `run-ci` label to start.\n",
